failure.message:
1. Test Case ID: mbBmHu

- API rejected schema-compliant request

    Valid data should have been accepted
    Expected: 2xx, 401, 403, 404, 5xx

[400] Bad Request:

    `{
      "error": {
        "code": "parameter_invalid_empty",
        "doc_url": "https://stripe.com/docs/error-codes/parameter-invalid-empty",
        "message": "You passed an empty string for 'name'. We assume empty values are an attempt to unset a parameter; however 'name' cannot be unset. You should remove 'name' from your request or supply a non-empty value.",
        "param": "name",
        "request_log_url": "https://dashboard.stripe.com/test/logs/req_5PIHRJqxISCOqv?t=1766927731",
        "type": "invalid_request_error"
      }
    }`

Reproduce with: 

    curl -X POST -H 'Authorization: [Filtered]' -H 'Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded' -d name= https://api.stripe.com/v1/products

2. Test Case ID: HZH7Hz

- Response violates schema

    'code' is a required property

    Schema at /properties/error:

        {
            "required": [
                "code",
                "message",
                "type"
            ],
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
                "code": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "parameter_missing",
                    "description": "Machine-readable error code."
                },
                "doc_url": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "uri",
                    "description": "Link to Stripe documentation for this error.",
                    "example": "https://stripe.com/docs/error-codes/parameter-missing"
                },
                "message": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Human-readable error message providing more details about the error.",
                    "example": {
                        "Missing required param": "name."
                    }
                },
                "param": {
                    "anyOf": [
                        {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "The name of the parameter related to the error, if applicable.",
                            "example": "name"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "null"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "request_log_url": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "uri",
                    "description": "Link to the request log entry in the Stripe Dashboard.",
                    "example": "https://dashboard.stripe.com/test/logs/req_hooQodrQWTeFut?t=1759996053"
                },
                "type": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "The type of error (e.g., `api_error`, `invalid_request_error`).",
                    "example": "invalid_request_error"
                }
            }
        }

    Value:

        {
            "message": "Invalid array",
            "param": "images",
            "request_log_url": "https://dashboard.stripe.com/test/logs/req_pmtONNAnQzxSC3?t=1766927808",
            "type": "invalid_request_error"
        }

[400] Bad Request:

    `{
      "error": {
        "message": "Invalid array",
        "param": "images",
        "request_log_url": "https://dashboard.stripe.com/test/logs/req_pmtONNAnQzxSC3?t=1766927808",
        "type": "invalid_request_error"
      }
    }`

Reproduce with: 

    curl -X POST -H 'Authorization: [Filtered]' -H 'Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded' -d 'name=s%F4%8F%8A%B6%EC%9E%99h%E2%AF%A5T%C3%BE%C3%B2%14%C3%80&shippable=True&images=https%3A%2F%2Fv.n.q.w.Q.g.GlE&images=https%3A%2F%2FW.z3huLao03.e.gn&images=https%3A%2F%2FCVJ.h.pMH.xn--jVr189M&images=https%3A%2F%2FR.nogRAF.mb.consulTINg&images=https%3A%2F%2FX0iMg.ro.c.QV0.z.Gf&images=https%3A%2F%2Fv.k0.ne&images=https%3A%2F%2FW.mR&images=https%3A%2F%2FN.A.XN--JvR189M' https://api.stripe.com/v1/products
